MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The memory cards feel like natural next purchases because I repeatedly buy SD and microSD cards. The 32GB microSD with an adapter especially matches capacities and formats I have used before.",
    "The HD streaming stick offers a plausible new use for my existing TV, while the HDMI cable fits my recurring interest in practical connection accessories when I have a specific need."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The 4K streaming stick gives me little reason to choose it over the HD option for my listed 720p TV, and another tablet does not address a clear need when I already have a Fire 7 and its accessories.",
    "The Echo Dot and smart plug assume an interest in voice assistants or home automation that I have not shown. The 16TB drive also goes far beyond the portable memory needs reflected in my purchases."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Owning a Fire tablet seems to have been taken as interest in a wider range of Amazon devices, although my purchases do not establish a desire for Alexa or home automation.",
    "My repeated memory-card purchases seem to have been interpreted as interest in storage generally, but a large desktop drive serves a different purpose from interchangeable SD and microSD cards."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated purchases of cables, mounts, card holders and other accessories suggest that fitting equipment I already own matters more to me than adding another main device.",
    "Compatibility and an immediate use matter: an SD card needs to fit my camera, a cable needs the right connection and length, and a streaming device should suit my TV. Similar product names alone do not establish those needs."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my interest in memory cards and useful electronics accessories, but stretch that interest too far into additional devices and unrelated storage needs."
}
